BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7c4a78870d13972d@ignite-gnv-events
DTSTAMP:20261025T041905Z
SUMMARY:aiGNV October 2026 Lunch Meetup: Trends\, Tools\, Real Use Cases
DTSTART:20261014T153000Z
DTEND:20261014T170000Z
LOCATION:Las Carretas Mexican Restaurant Gainesville\, 3501 Southwest 2nd A
 venue\, Gainesville\, FL 32607
URL:https://startgnv.com/event/aignv-october-2026-lunch-meetup-trends-tools
 -real-use-cases/
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a casual lunch meetup to dive into the latest trend
 s\, tools\, and real-world use cases in AI.\n\nWelcome to the monthly AI f
 or Business Meetup!\n\nPresented by startGNV & GNV.AI\n\nJoin us for the f
 irst AI for Business Lunch Meetup. It’ll be full of useful insight and r
 eal talk about how local businesses are putting AI to work today. Whether 
 you’re a founder\, freelancer\, manager\, marketer\, or just AI-curious\
 , this meetup is a chance to connect with others in the Gainesville busine
 ss and tech community who are testing\, building\, and learning in real-ti
 me.\n\nWe’ll kick things off with an opportunity to order lunch during a
 n informal meet and greet at 11:30 am\, followed by a few short\, no-fluff
  presentations from local operators showing what they’re doing with AI t
 ools and more—and how it’s affecting their workflows\, output\, and bo
 ttom line. Co-hosted by startGNV and GNV.AI\, this is your front-row seat 
 to how generative AI is being applied right here in Gainesville and around
  North Central Florida.\n\nThere is plenty of parking. The meeting will be
  in the third-floor meeting room.\nHosted by: startGNV\nstartGNV: https://
 startgnv.com/event/aignv-october-2026-lunch-meetup-trends-tools-real-use-c
 ases/\naiGNV / GNV.AI: https://gnv.ai/events/ai-for-business-lunch-and-lea
 rn\nstartGNV (Eventbrite): https://www.eventbrite.com/e/aignv-october-2026
 -lunch-meetup-trends-tools-real-use-cases-tickets-1990800743615
END:VEVENT
