SUMMARY:A Practical Guide To HealthTech Fundraising (Lunch & Learn)
DTSTART:20261029T160000Z
DTEND:20261029T170000Z
LOCATION:UF Innovate | The Hub\, 747 SW Second Avenue\, Gainesville\, FL 32
 607
URL:https://calendar.ufl.edu/innovate/event/58515-a-practical-guide-to-heal
 thtech-fundraising-lunch-lear
DESCRIPTION:About our speaker:Alberto Chan\nAlberto Chan is co-founder of R
 aiseHealth.co (https://raisehealth.co/)\, an AI chief of staff for healtht
 ech + medtech fundraising. He has held executive roles across venture capi
 tal\, healthcare\, medtech\, hospitality\, and entrepreneurship\, supporti
 ng fundraising efforts exceeding eight figures while in C-level positions.
  Alberto is also a former entrepreneur-in-residence and entrepreneurship i
 nstructor at UTSA\, focusing on healthcare commercialization\, payer dynam
 ics\, and go-to-market strategy. He holds a master’s degree from Carnegi
 e Mellon University.About RaiseHealth:\nHealthcare capital rarely fails be
 cause the science is wrong—it fails because the fundraising process is b
 roken. At RaiseHealth\, the team runs the operational engine behind health
 care fundraises\, taking the administrative heavy lifting off founders. Th
 rough high-fit investor matching\, pre-meeting intelligence dossiers\, pip
 eline tracking\, follow-ups\, and more\, RaiseHealth enables founders to f
 ocus on pitch execution and clinical scale.Thank you to our sponsors:\n\n 
 ———————UF Innovate | Accelerate\nUF Innovate | Accelerate is
  the University of Florida’s entrepreneurship support program that inclu
 des Sid Martin Biotech\, the globally recognized biotechnology incubator l
 ocated in Progress Park in Alachua\, Florida\, and The Hub\, the globally 
 recognized diversified tech incubator located in Gainesville’s Innovatio
 n District.\nHosted by: UF Innovate\nUF Innovate: https://calendar.ufl.edu
 /innovate/event/58515-a-practical-guide-to-healthtech-fundraising-lunch-le
 ar\nstartGNV: https://startgnv.com/event/a-practical-guide-to-healthtech-f
 undraising-lunch-learn/
END:VEVENT
