DESCRIPTION:The premier annual celebration of North Central Florida's thriv
 ing innovation ecosystem\, organized by startGNV.\n\ncelebrateGNV: Honorin
 g Innovation in North Central Florida\n\nJoin us for an evening of celebra
 tion of the individuals and companies that are driving North Central Flori
 da’s thriving startup and innovation ecosystem. celebrateGNV brings toge
 ther entrepreneurs\, mentors\, business leaders\, and community builders f
 or an inspiring dinner event recognizing those who are making a real diffe
 rence in our region.\n\nWhat to Expect\n\n• Dinner experience with wine 
 and beer service\n\n• Award presentations honoring outstanding contribut
 ors to our innovation community\n\n• Networking opportunities with fello
 w entrepreneurs\, mentors\, and business leaders\n\n• Inspiring stories 
 from those building the future of North Central Florida’s startup scene\
 n\nAwards Categories\n\n• Professional Mentor of the Year – Recognizin
 g exceptional guidance and support\n\n• Community Builder – Celebratin
 g those who strengthen our entrepreneurial ecosystem\n\n• Employer of th
 e Year – Honoring companies creating opportunities and fostering innovat
 ion\n\n• Community Impact Company of the Year – Recognizing establishe
 d companies making a meaningful difference in our region\n\n• Rising Sta
 r Startup – Celebrating a pre-seed startup with exceptional potential fo
 r success (includes $5\,000 prize)\n\nWhether you’re a startup founder\,
  seasoned entrepreneur\, mentor\, or simply passionate about innovation in
  North Central Florida\, this is your opportunity to celebrate achievement
 s\, connect with like-minded professionals\, and be inspired by the incred
 ible work happening in our community.\n\nCome raise a glass to the people 
 and organizations making North Central Florida a premier destination for s
 tartups and innovation!\nHosted by: startGNV\nstartGNV: https://startgnv.c
 om/event/celebrategnv-2026/\nstartGNV (Eventbrite): https://www.eventbrite
 .com/e/celebrategnv-2026-tickets-1743805381839
END:VEVENT
