UID:0e7fe438d3305f56@ignite-gnv-events
DTSTAMP:20261025T041905Z
SUMMARY:Off The Couch Book Tour + Fireside Chat
DTSTART:20261109T180000Z
DTEND:20261109T193000Z
LOCATION:UF Innovate | The Hub\, 747 SW Second Avenue\, Gainesville\, FL 32
 607
URL:https://calendar.ufl.edu/innovate/event/57413-off-the-couch-book-tour-f
 ireside-chat
DESCRIPTION:About the book:\nOff The Couch is the story of what happens whe
 n service becomes a habit instead of an assignment. It traces a path from 
 the discipline of the United States Air Force to the messy\, hopeful work 
 of building startup ecosystems in places that were told they’d never hav
 e one.\nAlong the way\, Robert unpacks the practical machinery of resilien
 ce: how to keep moving when the plan collapses\, how to turn data and hard
  truths into better decisions\, and how to build the kind of network that 
 catches founders before they fall.\nPart memoir\, part playbook\, this boo
 k (https://robertblacklidge.com/off-the-couch) is written for the person s
 till sitting on the couch — the veteran in transition\, the founder wait
 ing for permission\, the community leader wondering whether one person can
  move an entire ecosystem forward. The answer\, gathered across hundreds o
 f pitches\, mentors\, and midnight launches\, is yes.About our speaker:Rob
 ert Blacklidge\nRobert Blacklidge is an educator\, technology strategist\,
  and veteran with over twenty years of experience spanning military servic
 e\, enterprise data architecture\, and academic leadership. As a startup m
 entor and ecosystem builder\, he has guided over 100 founders through vent
 ure validation and scaling. Read more here. (https://robertblacklidge.com/
 off-the-couch)———————This event is worth 15 Hub House points
  so don’t miss your chance to help your team climb the leaderboard. Sele
 ct your Hub House when registering and rack up the points. If you’re not
  in a Hub House or not an Accelerate client\, select “Unknown.”——
 —————UF Innovate | Accelerate\nUF Innovate | Accelerate is the U
 niversity of Florida’s entrepreneurship support program that includes Si
 d Martin Biotech\, the globally recognized biotechnology incubator located
  in Progress Park in Alachua\, Florida\, and The Hub\, the globally recogn
 ized diversified tech incubator located in Gainesville’s Innovation Dist
 rict.\nHosted by: UF Innovate\nUF Innovate: https://calendar.ufl.edu/innov
 ate/event/57413-off-the-couch-book-tour-fireside-chat\nstartGNV: https://s
 tartgnv.com/event/off-the-couch-book-tour-fireside-chat/
END:VEVENT
