 vember 10\n\n7:30 AM\n\nUF Hilton | Shula’s Private Dining Room\n\nJoin 
 us for an engaging look at how UF Health is expanding access to world clas
 s health care across North Central Florida. Michael Holmes\, Senior Vice P
 resident and Greater Gainesville Regional President for UF Health\, will d
